msgid "@niko The elevator's button panel."
msgstr "@niko エレベーターのボタンパネルだ。"

msgid "@plight_worry Hey, where are you going?"
msgstr "@plight_worry おい、どこに行くんだ？"

msgid "@plight_unknown Come ooonnnnnnn!"
msgstr "@plight_unknown 頼むよおおぉぉぉ！"

msgid "@plight_unknown Come ooonnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnnn!!!!!"
msgstr ""
"@plight_unknown 頼むからあああ\n"
"あああぁぁぁぁぁぁぁ！！！！！"

msgid "@plight_unknown Work already!!!"
msgstr "@plight_unknown 動いてくれ！！！"

msgid "@niko_speak Huh?"
msgstr "@niko_speak え？"

msgid "@niko Oh right... \\@niko_eyeclosed The elevator guy."
msgstr "@niko あ、分かった…\\@niko_eyeclosed エレベーターの人だ。"

msgid "@plight_unknown AAAAUHGGHHHH!!!!"
msgstr "@plight_unknown あああああああああ！！！"

msgid "@niko_speak I think we should go talk to the guy first, \\p..."
msgstr ""
"@niko_speak 先に、あの人に\n"
"声かけようよ、 \\p…"

msgid "PATH CLOSED"
msgstr "通り道閉鎖"

msgid "TO: OFFICE"
msgstr "行先:オフィス"

msgid "@plight Come oonnn..."
msgstr "@plight 頼むよおおぉ…"

msgid "@plight_wtf Come oonnnnnnn!"
msgstr "@plight_wtf 頼むよおおおおぉぉぉ！"

msgid "@plight_wtf Now, of all times...!"
msgstr "@plight_wtf 何で、よりにもよって今…！"

msgid "@niko ...Uh"
msgstr "@niko …えっと"

msgid "@niko_speak ....Excuse me..."
msgstr "@niko_speak …あの…"

msgid "@plight_shock Woah!"
msgstr "@plight_shock うわあ！"

msgid "@plight ...you're... you!"
msgstr "@plight …君は…君か！"

msgid "@plight_worry (Ah geez, I didn't think I was gonna run into...)"
msgstr "@plight_worry （しまった、まさか出くわすとは…）"

msgid "@niko The elevator is missing a button, right?"
msgstr "@niko エレベーターにボタンがないんでしょ？"

msgid "@plight_worry ...how did you know?"
msgstr "@plight_worry …何で知ってるんだ？"

msgid "@niko_83c ..."
msgstr "@niko_83c …"

msgid "@niko_speak \\p and I will help you fix it!"
msgstr ""
"@niko_speak ミーと \\pが\n"
"直すのを手伝うよ！"

msgid "@plight_worry2 ...seriously?"
msgstr "@plight_worry2 …マジか？"

msgid "@plight_sigh Oh thank goodness."
msgstr "@plight_sigh いや、本当に助かる。"

msgid "@plight_worry2 The evacuees are counting on this...\\> on me..."
msgstr ""
"@plight_worry2 避難者たちが、コレを待ちわびてるのさ…\\>\n"
"おれのこともな…"

msgid "@plight_worry But... I've been here for hours and can't figure out a thing!"
msgstr ""
"@plight_worry だが…もうここに何時間もいるのに、\n"
"何一つ解決できやしない！"

msgid "@niko2 ....\\.\\.evacuees?"
msgstr "@niko2 …\\.\\.避難者って？"

msgid "@plight Y'know... from the west apartments."
msgstr "@plight ほら…西のアパートから来た奴らさ。"

msgid "@plight_worry The square stuff wrecked the place yesterday..."
msgstr ""
"@plight_worry 昨日、四角形のせいで\n"
"居住地がめちゃくちゃになったんだ…"

msgid "@niko3 Oh...."
msgstr "@niko3 そう…"

msgid "@plight_sigh Right now everyone's crowded in the cafe.\\nWe really want to get everyone to the surface as soon as possible, though."
msgstr ""
"@plight_sigh 今はみんなカフェのほうにいる。\\n早く地表に連れていって\n"
"あげたいんだがな。"

msgid "@plight3 The library on the surface doubles as a shelter for situations like this."
msgstr ""
"@plight3 地表にある図書館は、こういう時に\n"
"避難用の場所になってるのさ。"

msgid "@niko I see..."
msgstr "@niko そうなんだ…"

msgid "@niko2 ...wait... didn't we find the magnets and stuff in the apartments, \\p?"
msgstr ""
"@niko2 …あれ…そのアパートで磁石か何か\n"
"見つけなかったっけ、 \\p？"

msgid "@plight_worry The... what?"
msgstr "@plight_worry あー…何て？"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Looks like we'll have to find some other way to fix the button, \\p..."
msgstr ""
"@niko_eyeclosed はあ、ボタンを直すのに、また別の方法を\n"
"見つけなくちゃだね、 \\p…"

msgid "@plight_scared HOLY F\\.\\.\\@plight_worry UDGE"
msgstr "@plight_scared あっぶ\\.\\.\\@plight_worry っね"

msgid "@niko3 ..."
msgstr "@niko3 …"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed ...Looks like \\p and I will need to find another way down altogether..."
msgstr ""
"@niko_eyeclosed …ミーと \\pで、別の道を\n"
"探さなきゃダメみたいだね…"

msgid "@plight_worry But...\\.\\. this is the only elevator in the area..."
msgstr ""
"@plight_worry でも…\\.\\. この区域だと、エレベーターは\n"
"これしかない…"

msgid "@niko We did hear about another one, but... I don't really know where it is."
msgstr "@niko エレベーターはもう一つあるって\n"
"聞いたけど…どこにあるんだろう。"

msgid "@niko_speak Do you, \\p?"
msgstr "@niko_speak \\pは知ってる？"

msgid "TO: CAFE"
msgstr "行先:オフィスビルおよびカフェ"

msgid "[NO TRESPASSING!]"
msgstr "[立ち入り禁止]"

msgid "@niko Oh...excuse me!"
msgstr "@niko ああ…失礼！"

msgid "TO: APARTMENTS"
msgstr "行先:アパート"

msgid "TO:\\nOFFICE BUILDING AND\\nCAFE"
msgstr "行先:\\nオフィスビルおよび\\nカフェ"

msgid "@niko It's an elevator."
msgstr "@niko エレベーターだ。"

msgid "@niko_speak Let's find another way down!"
msgstr "@niko_speak 下に降りる他の方法を見つけよう！"

msgid "@plight_worry Uh..."
msgstr "@plight_worry ええと…"

msgid "@plight3 Let me know if you need my help with anything..."
msgstr ""
"@plight3 何かおれにできることがあったら\n"
"言ってくれよ…"

msgid "@niko_speak We found some elevators!"
msgstr "@niko_speak エレベーター見つけたよ！"

msgid "@plight_shock What??"
msgstr "@plight_shock え？？"

msgid "@plight_worry ...seriously?"
msgstr "@plight_worry …マジで？"

msgid "@plight_worry2 I've literally never seen another one in this area!"
msgstr ""
"@plight_worry2 この区域で、他にエレベーターなんて\n"
"見たことないぞ！"

msgid "@niko It WAS in a locked room..."
msgstr "@niko 鍵がかかってた部屋にあって…"

msgid "@plight_worry Oh...."
msgstr "@plight_worry はあ…"

msgid "@plight_worry2 Do they... uh... \\.\\.\\.\\@plight_worry work?"
msgstr "@plight_worry2 それで…ええと…\\.\\.\\.\\@plight_worry 動くのか？"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed We don't know yet..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed まだ分かんない…"

msgid "@niko One of them has a lever that's out of my reach."
msgstr ""
"@niko 片方のエレベーターにレバーが\n"
"あったんだけど、手が届かなくて。"

msgid "@niko_speak ...wait! You can help us!"
msgstr "@niko_speak …あっ！お兄さんならいける！"

msgid "@plight_worry What..."
msgstr "@plight_worry え…"

msgid "@niko You should be able to reach the lever, cuz...\\>\\n\\@niko_speak You're taller than me!"
msgstr ""
"@niko お兄さんならレバーに届くはず。\n"
"だって…\\>\\n\\@niko_speak ミーより背が高いもん！"

msgid "@plight3 Ooh... \\@plight_worry I... guess I am?"
msgstr "@plight3 あー… \\@plight_worry そう…かもな？"

msgid "@plight So...\\.\\. show me the way, I suppose..."
msgstr "@plight じゃあ…\\.\\. 道案内してくれないかな…"

msgid "@niko Mhm!"
msgstr "@niko うん！"

msgid "[HELLO.]"
msgstr "[どうモ。]"

msgid "[THIS AREA IS UNAUTHORIZED FOR DEMO.]"
msgstr ""
"[この地域はデモバージョンでは\n"
"使用できません。]"

msgid "[SORRY ABOUT THE INCONVENIENCE.]"
msgstr "[ご迷惑をおかけして申し訳ないです。]"

msgid "@niko ...Demo?"
msgstr "@niko …デモバージョン？"

msgid "[I CANNOT LET YOU THROUGH.]"
msgstr "[通行は許可できません。]"
